Audio Duration: 1m 22.3s (82.26s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 09:35:26 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个世界只有两种人
Segment #2   [00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:04,320] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 11 | Text: 第一种是能够在自己的错误中
Segment #3   [00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,120] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 反思教训总结经验的人
Segment #4   [00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,560] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 我把它称之为聪明人
Segment #5   [00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,300] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为这个世界有很多蠢人
Segment #6   [00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,460] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 他会一错再错
Segment #7   [00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,700] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 不懂得在自己的错误上
Segment #8   [00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,160] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 思考教训总结经验
Segment #9   [00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,320] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 同一个错误犯三遍犯五遍
Segment #10  [00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,260] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 这种人太傻了
Segment #11  [00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,820] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 其实只要能在自己的错误中
Segment #12  [00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:19,440] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 反思就已经很棒了
Segment #13  [00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,240] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 那还有第二种人
Segment #14  [00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,020] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 5  | Text: 第二种人是什么
Segment #15  [00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,800] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 12 | Text: 是能够通过别人身上的错误
Segment #16  [00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,640] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 思考自己的经验和教训
Segment #17  [00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,020] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 这种人就是比较聪明的
Segment #18  [00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:27,740] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 那很显然
Segment #19  [00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,740] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 我做不到第二种人
Segment #20  [00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:29,720] | Elapsed:  16.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 我只能做第一种人
Segment #21  [00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,440] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是我觉得做第一种人也挺好
Segment #22  [00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:34,120] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是在反思的同时
Segment #23  [00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:36,580] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实我不知道有多少底层家庭
Segment #24  [00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,480] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 11 | Text: 出生的农村人和我一样的
Segment #25  [00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,960] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 我不知道你们有没有这样的
Segment #26  [00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:40,460] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 一种感受
Segment #27  [00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,080] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是我们小的时候打那个游戏机
Segment #28  [00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,360] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 合金蛋头 拳皇
Segment #29  [00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,060] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 这些往里途避的
Segment #30  [00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,280] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们玩没玩过这种游戏
Segment #31  [00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,660] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 我觉得我们这种
Segment #32  [00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:50,700] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 12 | Text: 穷人家的孩子就像打游戏一样
Segment #33  [00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:52,100] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们哪怕技术再高
Segment #34  [00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,000] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 12 | Text: 我们哪怕打到第九十九关挂了
Segment #35  [00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,040] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们要冲突再来
Segment #36  [00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,260] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为我们没有试错成本
Segment #37  [00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,880] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是有试错成本的人
Segment #38  [00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,880] | Elapsed:  35.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 或者说家庭条件
Segment #39  [00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,780] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 比较夯实的人
Segment #40  [00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,760] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 他打游戏机
Segment #41  [00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:02,040] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 8  | Text: 他哪怕他技术再不好
Segment #42  [00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,000] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 哪怕他做人的
Segment #43  [00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,560] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 8  | Text: 文人处事能力有问题
Segment #44  [00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,500] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 他的这个话都说不清楚
Segment #45  [00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,920] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 8  | Text: 人都跟个傻子一样
Segment #46  [00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,040] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 4  | Text: 技术再不好
Segment #47  [00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,440] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 9  | Text: 他可以通过不断的叙避
Segment #48  [00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:12,940] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 哪怕他打得再不好
Segment #49  [00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:13,920] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 他有足够的子弹
Segment #50  [00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:14,780] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 让他打到通关
Segment #51  [00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:15,840] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是我们不行
Segment #52  [00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,080] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说人不能败
Segment #53  [00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,200] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 人得三四二后行
Segment #54  [00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,320] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 钱放在多里
Segment #55  [00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,160] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 千万别往外掏
Segment #56  [00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:20,980] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 3  | Text: 老天们
Segment #57  [00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:21,900] | Elapsed:  50.93s | Words: 4  | Text: 千万别掏
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
